A live {{PAGENAME}}. You can right-click it and select "Wring Neck" to kill it and receive a [[Dead Mole]].

==Hunting==

Capturing a mole is relatively easy:<br>
1. Get close to the mole.<br>
2. Start running.<br>
3. It may try to escape by burrowing underground, but it won't go far.<br>
3.1 '''Note''' that mole can't burrow on any non-grassland biome.<br>
4. Click it again.<br>
5. Repeat 4 or 5 times and the mole will stop burrowing, and you can chase it down.<br>
(''W15 note: On [[Cloud Range]] terrain some mole burrowed away at least ten times.)

